window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A city besieged, a realm divided, and a queen in peril.</b><br> <br> My new home is in danger and I still have so much to learn. I should be grateful that I’ve finally found all five members of my Guard, but one of them is on the wrong side of the war tearing Faerie apart.<br> <br> After diving in front of a killing blow intended for my brother, I’m reborn far from the safety of my palace walls. Exhausted and out of options, my only choice is to flee.<br> <br> My treacherous guard will stop at nothing in his quest to catch me, but what will he do if he succeeds?</p> <p><b>This is a slow burn reverse harem novel intended for mature listeners only.</b></p>"; 
